@host = http://localhost:5238

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Log in as admin (copy the token into @token below)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@clinicflow.com", "password": "Admin@123" }

###
@token = paste-token-here

### Pending appointments
GET {{host}}/api/appointments?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Doctors
GET {{host}}/api/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
